OL,3,GNEWSALimavady Courthouse to permanently
OL,4,Aclose
OL,5,
OL,6,FLimavady Courthouse is to permanently
OL,7,Fclose following a public consultation,
OL,8,FJustice Minister Naomi Long has said.
OL,10,FThe building was temporarily closed in
OL,11,F2020 during the Covid-19 pandemic and
OL,12,Fdid not reopen after restrictions were
OL,13,Flifted.
OL,15,FIt was last used for court business in
OL,16,FMarch 2020, when it opened once a week
OL,17,Ffor Adult Magistrates' Court
OL,18,Fproceedings, before those proceedings
OL,19,Fwere moved to Coleraine Courthouse.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
