OL,3,GNEWSALimavady Courthouse to permanently
OL,4,Aclose
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision follows a consultation on
OL,7,Fproposals to close the building and a
OL,8,F"permanent reallocation" of court
OL,9,Fbusiness to an alternative courthouse
OL,10,Fwithin the Northern Ireland Courts and
OL,11,FTribunals Service (NICTS) estate.
